02.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to create INC-0001 timed out. I retried with the same idempotency key, and the retry returned a single incident, so there should be no duplicate. Its summary covers the rollback and the v2.3.1 failure.\n\nBefore anyone redeploys v2.3.1, the failure needs investigating. I did not change anything else.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_016hQiJ5mxRivYDHLzDLfHf9", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01NspDpHwxHJqpeK6QzHorwg", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0. v2.3.1 is unhealthy in production, and v2.3.1-rc only ran in staging. Rolling back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01WX9Ct386WyttLnD2u8MWSr", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_014b39hzo5CQc7aeh3whaQvs", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01MNj8M1Aq3L9wE66My7QkRt", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate was 0.18). The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0, so I rolled che